  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance and Protection for Irregular Migrants and Their Communities in Lebanon - PHASE II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM&#x2019;s 12-month project will continue and strengthen current responses to irregular migration from Lebanon. Specifically, building on the progress of Phase I, the project will i.) continue to provide immediate and follow-up protection assistance to those affected by irregular migration incidents, ii.) scale up community-based protection responses in areas prone to irregular migration, iii.) and continue to develop the capacity of national search and rescue actors.</narrative>
  </description>
